{"id":4038,"date":"2025-10-30T12:37:55","date_gmt":"2025-10-30T12:37:55","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/fourci.org\/?p=4038"},"modified":"2025-10-30T12:42:01","modified_gmt":"2025-10-30T12:42:01","slug":"join-our-vendor-community-register-pre-qualify-now","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/fourci.org\/blog\/join-our-vendor-community-register-pre-qualify-now\/","title":{"rendered":"Join Our Vendor Community \u2013 Register &#038; Pre-Qualify Now!"},"content":{"rendered":"<p data-start=\"266\" data-end=\"453\">Are you ready to partner with FOURCi and contribute to meaningful change? We\u2019re inviting suppliers and service providers to register and pre-qualify with us for upcoming opportunities in:<\/p>\n<ul data-start=\"455\" data-end=\"703\">\n<li data-start=\"455\" data-end=\"486\">\n<p data-start=\"457\" data-end=\"486\">Resilient agricultural kits<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"487\" data-end=\"513\">\n<p data-start=\"489\" data-end=\"513\">Poultry chicks &amp; feeds<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"514\" data-end=\"546\">\n<p data-start=\"516\" data-end=\"546\">Fertilizers &amp; agro-chemicals<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"547\" data-end=\"565\">\n<p data-start=\"549\" data-end=\"565\">Tree seedlings<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"566\" data-end=\"604\">\n<p data-start=\"568\" data-end=\"604\">Printing &amp; IEC material production<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"605\" data-end=\"651\">\n<p data-start=\"607\" data-end=\"651\">Media services (radio, video, photography)<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"652\" data-end=\"703\">\n<p data-start=\"654\" data-end=\"703\">Catering services &amp; food demonstration supplies<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p data-start=\"705\" data-end=\"867\">By completing our <strong data-start=\"723\" data-end=\"771\">Vendor Registration &amp; Pre-Qualification Form<\/strong>, you\u2019ll join a vetted pool of vendors eligible for future procurement invitations and projects.<\/p>\n<h3 data-start=\"869\" data-end=\"910\">Why Become a FOURCi-Qualified Vendor?<\/h3>\n<ul data-start=\"911\" data-end=\"1194\">\n<li data-start=\"911\" data-end=\"985\">\n<p data-start=\"913\" data-end=\"985\">Be considered for contracts in high-impact climate resilience programs<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"986\" data-end=\"1052\">\n<p data-start=\"988\" data-end=\"1052\">Gain visibility and credibility with FOURCi\u2019s procurement team<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"1053\" data-end=\"1122\">\n<p data-start=\"1055\" data-end=\"1122\">Secure access to timely opportunities aligned with your expertise<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"1123\" data-end=\"1194\">\n<p data-start=\"1125\" data-end=\"1194\">Demonstrate your compliance, capacity and track record to stand out<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<h3 data-start=\"1196\" data-end=\"1222\">What We\u2019re Looking For<\/h3>\n<p data-start=\"1223\" data-end=\"1264\">We welcome vendors who can demonstrate:<\/p>\n<ul data-start=\"1265\" data-end=\"1583\">\n<li data-start=\"1265\" data-end=\"1326\">\n<p data-start=\"1267\" data-end=\"1326\">Legal standing (CAC registration, TIN, relevant licences)<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"1327\" data-end=\"1386\">\n<p data-start=\"1329\" data-end=\"1386\">Minimum number of years of experience in their category<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"1387\" data-end=\"1448\">\n<p data-start=\"1389\" data-end=\"1448\">Technical capability and sufficient staffing or equipment<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"1449\" data-end=\"1507\">\n<p data-start=\"1451\" data-end=\"1507\">Proven past performance with references or work orders<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"1508\" data-end=\"1583\">\n<p data-start=\"1510\" data-end=\"1583\">Financial capacity to supply and deliver quality goods\/services on time<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<h3 data-start=\"1585\" data-end=\"1607\">How to Get Started<\/h3>\n<ol data-start=\"1608\" data-end=\"1896\">\n<li data-start=\"1608\" data-end=\"1652\">\n<p data-start=\"1611\" data-end=\"1652\">Click the link below to access the form<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"1653\" data-end=\"1740\">\n<p data-start=\"1656\" data-end=\"1740\">Provide your business details, category of interest, and upload required documents<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"1741\" data-end=\"1798\">\n<p data-start=\"1744\" data-end=\"1798\">Submit your registration and wait for our evaluation<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"1799\" data-end=\"1896\">\n<p data-start=\"1802\" data-end=\"1896\">If pre-qualified, you\u2019ll receive a vendor code and be eligible for FOURCi procurement events<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<\/ol>\n<p data-start=\"1898\" data-end=\"2010\">\ud83d\udc49 Complete the Vendor Registration &amp; Pre-Qualification Form<a href=\"https:\/\/docs.google.com\/forms\/d\/e\/1FAIpQLSeXddFNxUy6IwaFqlwkzoqJxSJ8uJWmliy2vWP85c2IFu1DXw\/viewform?usp=header\">https:\/\/docs.google.com\/forms\/d\/e\/1FAIpQLSeXddFNxUy6IwaFqlwkzoqJxSJ8uJWmliy2vWP85c2IFu1DXw\/viewform?usp=header<\/a><\/p>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>Are you ready to partner with FOURCi and contribute to meaningful change? We\u2019re inviting suppliers and service providers to register and pre-qualify with us for upcoming opportunities in: Resilient agricultural kits Poultry chicks &amp; feeds Fertilizers &amp; agro-chemicals Tree seedlings Printing &amp; IEC material production Media services (radio, video, photography) Catering services &amp; food demonstration [&hellip;]<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":0,"comment_status":"open","ping_status":"open","sticky":false,"template":"","format":"standard","meta":{"give_campaign_id":0,"_uag_custom_page_level_css":"","site-sidebar-layout":"default","site-content-layout":"","ast-site-content-layout":"default","site-content-style":"default","site-sidebar-style":"default","ast-global-header-display":"","ast-banner-title-visibility":"","ast-main-header-display":"","ast-hfb-above-header-display":"","ast-hfb-below-header-display":"","ast-hfb-mobile-header-display":"","site-post-title":"","ast-breadcrumbs